{"result":{"status":200,"page":"oc168","data":{"userDefinedFilter":{},"items":[{"photo":"wix:image://v1/577c92_c6da8b77b17540499b40801c33ba514b~mv2_d_4032_3024_s_4_2.jpg/20180820_181828.jpg#originWidth=4032&originHeight=3024","url":"http://www.theglasspantry.com/single-post/2017/09/20/Crispy-Salt-Pepper-Chicken","_id":"e54221a8-c604-4dad-af7c-adf326451817","_owner":"577c92d8-55f7-4f98-88a2-d8647b1c2c9c","_createdDate":{"$date":"2019-02-12T15:03:53.528Z"},"_updatedDate":{"$date":"2019-02-12T15:05:29.346Z"},"catagory":"Deep Fried","title":"Crispy Salt & Pepper Chicken","link-Recipes-catagory-catagory":"/Recipes/catagory/deep-fried"},{"photo":"image://v1/577c92_3799ea343752477abb81144e895ab67d~mv2.jpg/1448_1086/20171031_184232_edited.jpg","url":"http://www.theglasspantry.com/single-post/2017/11/10/Italian-Nachos-Johnny-Carinos-copycat","_id":"00787bcd-8058-4c04-93e6-16eb3c6cc82d","_owner":"577c92d8-55f7-4f98-88a2-d8647b1c2c9c","_createdDate":{"$date":"2018-05-18T20:04:43.681Z"},"_updatedDate":{"$date":"2018-05-18T20:04:49.971Z"},"catagory":"Deep Fried","title":"Italian Nachos ","link-Recipes-catagory-catagory":"/Recipes/catagory/deep-fried"},{"photo":"image://v1/577c92_698e9af808c343f580c6e872af81aee6~mv2_d_3354_2393_s_2.jpg/3354_2393/20170413_195053.jpg","url":"http://www.theglasspantry.com/single-post/2017/04/20/Szechuan-Salt-Pepper-Dungeness-Crab","_id":"53875683-6cf3-40ba-8757-d28db264f8d6","_owner":"577c92d8-55f7-4f98-88a2-d8647b1c2c9c","_createdDate":{"$date":"2018-05-18T20:02:44.478Z"},"_updatedDate":{"$date":"2018-05-18T20:02:52.601Z"},"catagory":"Deep Fried","title":"Szechuan Salt & Pepper Dungeness Crab","link-Recipes-catagory-catagory":"/Recipes/catagory/deep-fried"},{"photo":"image://v1/577c92_cf1f95df41bf4f16b201672f908c8ced~mv2_d_4032_3024_s_4_2.jpg/4032_3024/20180224_182926.jpg","url":"http://www.theglasspantry.com/single-post/2018/03/12/Ricotta-Stuffed-Wontons-2-Ways","_id":"97942679-2339-4b51-9a1d-e88aee6b8b2b","_owner":"577c92d8-55f7-4f98-88a2-d8647b1c2c9c","_createdDate":{"$date":"2018-05-18T20:02:01.807Z"},"_updatedDate":{"$date":"2018-05-18T20:02:08.488Z"},"ingredients":"<p>Ingredients</p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p>For Wontons</p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p>1 Beaten Egg</p>\n\n<p>1 Package Wonton Wrappers</p>\n\n<p>1 cup Ricotta</p>\n\n<p>4 Tablespoons shredded Parmesan</p>\n\n<p>2 teaspoons Italian seasoning</p>\n\n<p>Salt and Pepper to taste</p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p>For&nbsp;Browned Butter&nbsp;Ricotta Wontons with&nbsp;Frizzled Sage&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p>2-3 Tablespoons large fresh sage leaves rolled up like a cigar and sliced crosswise to create ribbons.</p>\n\n<p>1/4 butter</p>\n\n<p>1 1/2 Tablespoons olive oil</p>\n\n<p>12 -16 Ricotta Wontons (fresh or frozen)</p>","catagory":"Deep Fried","instructions":"<p>Method</p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p>To make the ricotta wontons:</p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p>Mix the ricotta with the beaten egg, the shredded Parmesan and&nbsp;Italian seasoning&nbsp;then salt and pepper to taste.&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p>Drop a small spoonful onto the center of the wonton square then use your finger to dampen the edges on the wonton with water then fold and press to seal as shown above.</p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p>Place the formed wontons onto a floured surface until you have finished filling all of the wonton wrappers.&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p>To freeze wontons:</p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p>Place the wontons on a sheet pan and freeze until firm then place them in a plastic freezer bag for storage. It&#39;s best to use them within 2-3 months.</p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p>To make Deep Fried Ricotta Wontons&nbsp;(from fresh or&nbsp;frozen)</p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p>Carefully drop the fresh or frozen wontons, one at a time, into a deep fryer set</p>\n\n<p>at 350 degrees for about 3 minutes or until golden brown. Serve immediately.</p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p>To make&nbsp;Browned Butter Ricotta Wontons with&nbsp;Frizzled Sage&nbsp; (from fresh or&nbsp;frozen)</p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p>Carefully drop the fresh or frozen wontons, one by one, into a pot of boiling water for about 2 minutes then remove with a slotted spoon and drain before adding to the saute&#39; pan.</p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p>While bringing the water to a boil for blanching the wontons, melt 1/4 cup butter and 1 1/2 tablespoons olive oil in a saute&#39; pan on medium heat. When the butter begins to sizzle and brown, add the ribbons of sage leaves and saute&#39; until they begin to crisp (about 1 minute).&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p>Add the drained wontons to the browned sage butter and saute&#39; until the edges of the wontons begin to brown and they are warmed completely through. Serve immediately.</p>","title":"Ricotta Stuffed Wontons 2 Ways","link-Recipes-catagory-catagory":"/Recipes/catagory/deep-fried"},{"photo":"image://v1/577c92_eb2b84b8da9c4f42851003aaf349c459~mv2.jpg/1500_1125/20171102_185429_edited.jpg","url":"http://www.theglasspantry.com/single-post/2018/04/01/Crispy-Fish-Tacos","_id":"08f9f6ef-a5db-4aa8-a6e5-5b15dca090e6","_owner":"577c92d8-55f7-4f98-88a2-d8647b1c2c9c","_createdDate":{"$date":"2018-05-18T20:01:03.558Z"},"_updatedDate":{"$date":"2018-05-18T20:01:12.650Z"},"catagory":"Deep Fried","title":"Crispy Fish Tacos with Cilantro Lime and Black Bean Brown Rice","link-Recipes-catagory-catagory":"/Recipes/catagory/deep-fried"},{"photo":"image://v1/577c92_fd1cf068a08b4c6dba86f6f12cf4622c~mv2_d_4032_3024_s_4_2.jpg/4032_3024/20170309_191603.jpg","url":"http://www.theglasspantry.com/single-post/2017/05/15/House-Made-Potato-Chips","_id":"cf072456-5b8d-451d-9d3c-9be4e145249a","_owner":"577c92d8-55f7-4f98-88a2-d8647b1c2c9c","_createdDate":{"$date":"2018-05-17T18:50:09.733Z"},"_updatedDate":{"$date":"2018-05-17T18:50:18.519Z"},"catagory":"Deep Fried","title":"House Made Potato Chips","link-Recipes-catagory-catagory":"/Recipes/catagory/deep-fried"}],"dynamicUrl":"/Recipes/catagory/{catagory}","config":{"dataset":{"collec